/**
 * Full references for the short citations in the rest of the app: the coach pages, player app, PDFs and tutorials
 * outside the training-programme rules (those live in `ruleRefs.ts`). Same checks: each paper fetched from PubMed
 * (E-utilities) or, where PubMed does not index the journal, Crossref, and the abstract (or full text where marked)
 * read against what each site says. Sites that said more than the paper shows were reworded; numbers were never
 * changed. Never guessed: a short that could not be pinned to one paper is in `UNRESOLVED_SHORTS` (ruleRefs.ts).
 *
 * Lot A (2026-11-24): injury and return-to-play pages, rehab tracks, the control-chaos continuum, movement screen
 * and corrective exercises, injury-risk rules.
 * Lot B (2026-11-24): the daily verdict and its signals (Decision Summary, coach signals, readiness, wellness, CMJ
 * and HRV reads, sprint exposure, robustness watch), the methodology page and its caveats.
 * Lot C (2026-11-24): load and GPS pages, deceleration, Periodization Hub, Train like you play, week setup,
 * post-match recovery, match demands, conditioning and speed zones, strength/speed text on those pages.
 * Lot D (2026-11-24): coach tutorials, PDF exports, player app, trainer/VBT pages, basketball, pricing.
 */
